flowchart TD
    A[Student opens Google Form] --> B[Enter Name, Email, Course]
    B --> C{Required fields complete?}
    C -- No --> D[Show validation message]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E{Email format valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Ask student to correct email]
    F --> B
    E -- Yes --> G[Submit registration]
    G --> H[Google Forms trigger / response received]
    H --> I[Google Sheets stores response row]
    I --> J[Check blank fields]
    J --> K[Check duplicate email]
    K --> L{Any issue found?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Flag record for human review]
    L -- No --> N[Mark record verified]
    M --> O[Correct / confirm record]
    N --> P[Registration record ready for review]
    O --> P
